  {
    "ref": "U00190",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e163]: The Hub Adapter gives you the perfect solution for attaching multiple accessories for your GoPro or other action video cameras. Providing a central connection point for multiple ¼” - 20 male accessories such as Locking Arms, Gorilla Pod Arms, flashes and microphones. Attach the base to a tripod and then up to 4 mounting solutions to film with multiple cameras or added accessories, or remove the male screw and knob for access to 6 attachment points. The Hub Adapter gives you one durable, central hub to attach all the accessories you need for the perfect shot."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00191",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e164]: For GoPro/Action Video Cameras, Tripods and Camera Accessories"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00192",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e165]: A durable, aluminum connection point for multiple ¼”-20 screw accessories such as the Locking Arm and GorillaPod Arm."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00193",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e166]: \"Ribbed knob for easy tightening: when mounting to a female 1⁄4\\\"-20 accessory, such as the Action Clamp, you can twist the top knob to tighten in place.\""
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00194",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e167]: \"Four to Six 1⁄4\\\"-20 mounting sockets: top screw can be removed to provide 6 sockets. Mount any male 1⁄4\\\"-20 accessory such as a tripod, GorillaPod Arm, or Locking Arm.\""
  },
